om-pose assets

The files in this folder (bodies/, clips/ and manifest.json) come from
OpenMarch's om-pose repository; SOURCE.json records the commit. They are not
covered by the OpenMarch application's license, and no license is granted for
them yet. All rights reserved.

- The reference bodies and the v4 skeleton are to be released under CC0 1.0
  once counsel has answered the open licensing question and om-pose adopts a
  license upstream.
- The motion clips are derived from performance footage and are held for
  legal review: no release that ships them goes out before counsel answers.

See docs/adr/0002-3d-view.md (D-7 and D-21) and docs/3d/props-spec.md
section 10.
